:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">C.N.A.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">No</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Direct Supervision:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">1.0 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Clinical Manager</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Position Summary:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Anesthesia Tech/CNA is responsible for assisting licensed anesthesia providers in the acquisition, preparation and application of the equipment and supplies required for the administration of anesthesia. They provide support by preparing and maintaining patient monitoring devices and anesthesia delivery systems before, during, and after anesthesia. The Tech will function as patient transporter when not completing anesthesia duties.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Education:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">High School graduate or equivalent.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Certification/Licensure:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Active Certified Nursing Assistant (C.N.A.) license in the state of Maryland required.</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Healthcare Provider CPR certification required.</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Certified Anesthesia Tech preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in; line-height:115%\"><a name=\"_Hlk215476528\"></a>Minimum one (1) year experience in hospital or related area, preferably in Surgical Services.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Schedule:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Monday – Friday, primarily day shift.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Please let me know if you have any questions.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">People Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tidalhealth.org</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}